cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper given in preferred-citation."
title: "TWN2N: Time-Window Noise2Noise"
abstract: >-
  Python library for the self-supervised blind denoising of multichannel signals measured in
  dynamical systems, such as vibration and impact signals. The network is trained on the noisy
  signals themselves, without a clean reference and without a description of the noise.
